url: >-
  https://github.com/helena-bioinformatics/endometrial-developmental-regulons
abstract: >-
  Computational and reproducibility record for the prespecified analysis of
  developmental transcription-factor regulons in endometrial carcinoma.
  The repository includes TCGA-UCEC discovery, CPTAC-UCEC external
  evaluation, sensitivity analyses, provenance records, machine-readable
  results, and release-verification tooling.
